Backport the event-port fallback polling fix from tokio-rs/mio PR #2005
at commit c0456063ffa2edd852b6a66afb0a36bf23eebb81.

Keep fallback readiness edge-like while ensuring that readable readiness is not
starved by unrelated port events and continuously writable descriptors cannot
make the selector spin. The upstream PR is tested on x86_64 and SPARC Solaris.

